@suryacommand @NorthernComd_IA @IaSouthern @easterncomd @IndiannavyMedia @IAF_MCC @SWComd_IA @westerncomd_IA @artrac_ia
@adgpi

#IMA
Lt Gen Gurmit Singh, PVSM, UYSM, AVSM, VSM (Retd), Hon’ble Governor of Uttarakhand, addressed the Officer Cadets at the Indian Military Academy, Dehradun on the theme “Indian Army Officer as a Nation Builder.” He emphasised Nation First – Rashtra Sarvo Pari, the legacy of supreme sacrifice and the noble responsibility of leadership in uniform.

Highlighting that learning is a continuous process, he spoke about the vital bond between officers and men in units and the evolving character of modern warfare involving AI, cyber, space and quantum technologies, as well as hybrid and proxy conflicts. Drawing inspiration from Guru Gobind Singh Ji, Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj and Maharana Pratap, he reminded officer cadets that an officer must be a soldier, a scholar and a saint prepared to safeguard national security and contribute to nation building, while also acknowledging the growing role of women in the Armed Forces.

#IndianArmy 
#IMA_Dehradun 
