India Triumphs at #YakAttack2026 in Nepal.

In a proud moment for the nation, Nk Khushiman Gharti of the Indian Army emerged as the overall champion of Yak Attack 2026, one of the world’s toughest high-altitude mountain biking races in Nepal.

Competing across six gruelling stages in the Annapurna region, covering over 250 km, climbing 9,000+ m and crossing the formidable Thorong La Pass (5,416 m), the entire Indian team showcased pure domination, exceptional endurance, determination and resilience, by bagging the 4th, 5th, 6th, 7th and 11th positions to bring glory to India.

This victory reflects the spirit of the Indian Army and India’s growing excellence in adventure sports.

#IndianArmy
#ArmyAdventureWing
#Cycling

