DG Integrated Training Visits Army Adventure Nodal Centres at 3 EME Centre, Bhopal

Lt Gen Ajay Ramdev, SM, Director General Integrated Training, President SSCB and Colonel Commandant, Army Service Corps, visited the Army Adventure Nodal Centres for Hot Air Ballooning and Windsurfing at 3 EME Centre, Bhopal. The visit highlighted the Indian Army’s commitment to fostering leadership, courage, resilience and operational readiness through adventure training, while reviewing the state-of-the-art facilities and ongoing training activities at the Centres.

