Nilgiri Cup Speed Climbing Competition

More than a hundred participants from across India competed in various categories at the Nilgiri Cup Speed Climbing Competition, showcasing exceptional talent and speed on the wall, with the Indian Army Sport Climbing Team (Service Zone) fielding 09 athletes in the Men’s Open Category.

Nk Sarvan Chauhan (Services) clocked an impressive 5.949 seconds to secure the Silver Medal and finished as the First Runner-Up in the Men’s Open Category.

