SAMUDRA PRADAKSHINA - Courage beyond borders

19,600 nautical miles behind us.
5,600 more to Mumbai.

Today at the Royal Cape Town Yacht Club, IASV Triveni set sail on her final ocean leg : Cape Town to Mumbai with six women officers, countless stories, and the spirit of a nation across the seas.

Flagged off in the presence of the RCYC Commodore, Mr Walter, Cdr Jackie Combrink, SA Navy, DA Pretoria Capt Atul Sapahia (IN), Col K Dhobal, CME, Mr Bhagwan Sahay Meena, HOC from CG Office & the Indian diaspora.

The mission continues.

