National Integration Tour 

The #IndianArmy conducted a National Integration Tour   for students of Government Secondary School, Nandok, #Sikkim, to promote national integration and youth empowerment through exposure to India’s cultural and institutional heritage.

Students visited key locations in West #Bengal, interacted with eminent dignitaries including the Hon’ble Governor of West Bengal, and explored places of national importance, reinforcing India’s unity in diversity.

