सर्वे सन्तु निरामया” — May All Be Free from Illness

In a continued series of outreach initiatives, medical camps were organised by the #IndianArmy at Rhenock, Zuluk and Kupup in East #Sikkim, with strong participation from locals and veterans. Comprehensive consultations, basic diagnostics and medicines were provided to address key healthcare needs. The series culminated at Kupup on the occasion of World Cancer Day, reinforcing commitment towards community health, veterans care and a strong civil–military bond.

