​#WesternCommand and #NDMA are joining forces for the landmark "Western Command Disaster Management Conclave 2026". 

​Bringing together the finest minds from the #IndianArmy and civil administration, this conclave aims to forge a unified front between military precision and civil governance for lightning-fast crisis response.

​Date: 28th Jan 2026
​Time: 0830 - 1700 Hrs
​Venue: Chandimandir Military Station, Western Command

​🌟 Key Leadership & Panelists
​Leading the charge are Lt Gen #ManojKumarKatiyar, #ArmyCommander and Lt Gen Syed Ata Hasnain (Retd), Member NDMA, alongside top officials from Punjab, Haryana, Himachal Pradesh, J&K and Uttarakhand.

​From strategic planning to boots-on-the-ground execution, we are strengthening the shield that protects our citizens. 🇮🇳

