Under the aegis of HQ Telangana & Andhra Sub Area (TASA), a high-impact #ExServicemenRally was conducted at #Kurnool, witnessing participation of nearly 2,000 #veterans , Veer Naris and Veer Matas. Maj Gen Ajay Misra, General Officer Commanding (GOC), TASA, addressed the gathering and interacted extensively with the veteran fraternity. The event was graced by Shri Bastipati Nagaraju Panchalingala, MP (Kurnool) and Shri TG Bharath, MLA (Kurnool) & Hon’ble Minister for Industries, Commerce & Food Processing, Govt of Andhra Pradesh.

08 Veer Naris were felicitated and 10 ESM were assisted with wheelchairs and walking sticks. Comprehensive policy and welfare updates were delivered by Colonel Veterans, Director Hospitals #ECHS, #AWPO, Director URC and Director Rajya Sainik Board. AWPO handed over 08 job/skill certificates and shortlisted 120 veterans for assured employment.

Nearly 989 grievances were received, with the majority resolved on the spot through proactive Record Office and CDA facilitation. Dedicated Revenue, Legal and HR helpdesks established by the District Administration addressed land and court cases, ensuring seamless single-window support.

