Guided by Hon’ble PM’s JAI mantra — Jointness, Aatmanirbharta and Innovation — the 𝐉𝐀𝐈 𝐒𝐞 𝐕𝐢𝐣𝐚𝐢 𝐒𝐞𝐦𝐢𝐧𝐚𝐫 𝟐𝟎𝟐𝟔 concluded at Southern Command after two days of focused deliberations on transforming the Indian Armed Forces into an integrated, future-ready and technologically empowered force for a rapidly evolving multi-domain security environment, aligned with the vision of Viksit Bharat.

