The day was marked by pride, camaraderie and gratitude, as veterans were honoured and pending grievances and pension-related issues were addressed by personnel from 18 Record Offices across the country. A range of welfare services, including eye, dental and hearing check-up counters, were also organised.

Veterans expressed heartfelt appreciation for the initiative, which concluded on a high note—reaffirming the #IndianArmy’s enduring commitment to support its veterans and their families.

