HQ Telangana & Andhra Sub Area, in close coordination with the Telangana State Government, conducted the Civil–Military Liaison Conference at Hyderabad. The engagement exemplified the Whole of Nation Approach, reinforcing institutional synergy between the Armed Forces and the Civil Administration in furtherance of National security and Nation building.

