Empowering Sporting Dreams: Military–Civil Fusion Opens Doors to Competitive Sailing 

In a maiden initiative reflecting strong Military–Civil Fusion, the #IndianArmy Yachting Node (#AYN), Mumbai has commenced training children from BMC schools for participation in national and international sailing regattas.

The initiative, driven by Maharashtra, Gujarat & Goa Area under the aegis of #SouthernCommand and the #MissionOlympicWing, is being conducted in coordination with the Brihanmumbai Municipal Corporation (#BMC). A total of 30 students have been selected to train in this elite sport — opening new horizons of opportunity, confidence and sporting excellence.

