Forging Battlefield Dominance through Relentless Training

#WhiteTigerDivision at #Babina, rigorously tested warfighting readiness under realistic, high-tempo combat conditions. The training exercise featured integrated mechanised manoeuvres and high-intensity force-on-force engagements across a contested battlespace, validating rapid decision-making, resilient command-and-control, armoured shock action and dominant close-quarter combat capability.

The training reaffirmed the formation’s ability to fight, manoeuvre and prevail across the spectrum of conflict — delivering swift, precise and decisive combat power whenever called upon.

