Strengthening Veteran Healthcare — #WeCare

A new ECHS Polyclinic was inaugurated today at Anantapur, Andhra Pradesh, by Maj Gen Ajay Misra, GOC Telangana & Andhra Sub Area, enhancing accessible and dependable healthcare for veterans and their families.

The modern facility will provide advanced medical, diagnostic and rehabilitative services — significantly strengthening healthcare infrastructure for the veteran community in the region.

#SouthernCommand remains committed to honouring our veterans’ service through dignified healthcare, stronger welfare initiatives and continued support to those who served the Nation.

