ASSAM RIFLES STRENGTHENS VETERAN WELFARE THROUGH OUTREACH DRIVE IN HARYANA
#AssamRifles successfully conducted an Outreach Drive at at Hansi, Haryana on 01 May 2026, witnessing an overwhelming participation of approximately 60 ARESM, widows and NOKs, including 02 AR Cadre Officers (Retd). The drive addressed 11 grievances, resolving 06 on the spot while 05 were retained for follow-up action. During the event, 26 Ex-Servicemen were registered on the Sampark Setu App, widows were felicitated and a free medical aid was provided to 17 ARESM. The event concluded with tea and refreshments for all attendees. The initiative reaffirmed Assam Rifles steadfast commitment to veteran welfare and its enduring bond with the ESM community.

