ASSAM RIFLES CELERATES 191st RAISING DAY AT GHASPANI, NAGALAND
191st #AssamRifles Day was celebrated at Ghaspani Garrison, Chumoukedima (Nagaland) on 24 March 2026 with pride and solemnity. The day began with a wreath-laying ceremony and unfurling of the Assam Rifles flag, honouring fallen heroes and the force’s rich legacy. A special address highlighted operational achievements, civil-military cooperation and welfare initiatives under the Year of the Soldier theme. Troops were also briefed on future plans to enhance capability and quality of life. The celebrations concluded with a renewed sense of unity, pride and commitment among all ranks.

