ASSAM RIFLES CELEBRATES 191ST RAISING DAY #AssamRifles celebrated its 191st Raising Day with great pride and solemnity at its headquarters in Shillong on 24 March 2026. The occasion marked over a century of dedicated service, valour and unwavering commitment to safeguarding the nation’s frontiers. A Special Sainik Sammelan was conducted, fostering interaction and strengthening the bond between leadership and troops. The ceremony also witnessed the presentation of awards and honours recognizing exceptional courage and distinguished service. Cheques were presented to the Bravest of the Brave awardee, COAS Unit Citation awardees and GOC-in-C Eastern Command Unit Citation awardees, alongwith DGAR Commendation Cards to deserving personnel. These recognitions underscored the Force’s continued excellence, professionalism and dedication in maintaining peace and security across challenging operational environments. 

