Military History & Nation-Building
Lt Gen Ajay Chandpuria, #GOC #VajraCorps, formally launched the book titled “Armed Forces and the Freedom Movement:1903–1947”; by eminent Historian, Educationist & Author Shri JC Joshi, a Distinguished Scholar with a lifelong & pivotal contribution to India’s Historical and Academic Discourse.
