Hon’ble Chief Minister of Uttar Pradesh, Shri Yogi Adityanath, graced the  #NorthTechSymposium2026 at #Prayagraj on the concluding day. He was welcomed by #ArmyCdrCC and #ArmyCdrNC. Addressing the gathering, the Hon'ble Chief Minister presented Uttar Pradesh as a model state providing a strong ecosystem specially through development of the Defence Industrial Corridor, excellent #Infrastructure, simplified procedures, strong #Academia backup, support to #Innovation and a safe environment.
During his visit to  #Exhibition halls, he interacted with participants and  appreciated their efforts. He commended the #NorthernCommand,  #CentralCommand, #SIDM and  #UPEIDA for their exceptional #Synergy to organise this mega event. 

As part of the Symposium a seminar on 'Promotion of Defence Industry Harnessing through Resilient Uttar 
Pradesh Expressways Industrial Development Authority (UPEIDA) Verticals and Alliances' was held where eminent speakers shared their thoughts on the subject.

The three day grand event was a resounding success and a turning point towards achieving Atmanirbharta in Defence.

