Raksha Triveni Sangam - Where Technology, Industry & Soldiering Converge.

A Curtain Raiser event was organised at Manekshaw Centre #NewDelhi on 25 Mar 2026 as a prelude to #NorthTechSymposium2026 scheduled from 04-06 May 2026 at #Prayagraj. The event was graced by Lt Gen Anindya Sengupta #ArmyCdrCC, Lt Gen Pratik Sharma, #ArmyCdrNC,  Shri Neeraj Gupta, Vice President #SIDM and delegates from #Industry & #Academia.

Raksha Triveni Sangam is not just an event, it is a #Strategic collaboration aimed at bridging the gap between the operational requirements of the Armed Forces & technological capabilities emerging within India’s rapidly growing Defence Manufacturing Sector. 

The enthusiastic participation in Curtain Raiser from industry partners, start-ups and academic institutions showcased a shared commitment towards strengthening India’s defence capability and achieving the National goal of #RakshaAtmanirbharta.

