#OnThisDay
#03June1999

On this day, 18 GRENADIERS secured a vital foothold on the Tololing Complex. We salute the bravehearts whose dauntless courage and resolute leadership made it possible to achieve the impossible.

The supreme sacrifice and unwavering commitment of Lieutenant Colonel R Vishwanathan, VrC (P), Major Rajesh Singh Adhikari, MVC (P), Subedar Randhir Singh, VrC (P) and Havildar Ram Kumar, VrC (P) played a pivotal role in the capture of Point 4590, paving the way for the subsequent capture of Tololing—a turning point in Operation VIJAY.

India remembers with pride and gratitude. 🇮🇳

