 18 GRENADIERS launched the first daring assault on Tololing under impossible odds. This day marked the beginning of a 22 Day Long  display of the Indian Army’s unflinching resolve, as the battalion climbed near-vertical cliffs under murderous enemy fire.

The enemy's accurate mortar and artillery fire support during their defense of Tololing Top made it clear that 18 GRENADIERS is fighting not Mujahideens but Pak Regulars.

The call to evict intruders from Tololing was inevitable to clear enemy's interdiction over NH 1A, the lifeline of Ladakh.

 India remembers with pride & gratitude 🇮🇳

