Certificate Ceremony at University of Ladakh

University of Ladakh (UoL) conducted a course on the History, Geography & Culture of Ladakh for officers of the Indian Army, Indian Air Force and ITBP from 11 to 16 May 2026.

Maj Gen Sudhanshu Sharma, Chief of Staff, Fire and Fury Corps and Prof Saket Kushwaha, Vice Chancellor, UoL, addressed the participant officers and distributed certificates on successful completion of the course.

Certificates were also awarded to Army personnel who successfully completed courses on Solid Waste Management and Chinese Language conducted by UoL, along with a Cyber Security course conducted by Rashtriya Raksha University during Jan–Mar 2026.

The enduring partnership between UoL and Fire and Fury Corps continues to strengthen national security through academic collaboration, capacity building and Military-Civil Fusion.

