Leimakhong Military Station under #SpearCorps carried out a #HumanitarianRelief initiative at Leimakhong, #Manipur. Troops provided essential food supplies and critical support to 450 students affected by ongoing unrest. The outreach aimed at providing relief, encouragement and a sense of reassurance to young minds while strengthening the bond between the #IndianArmy and the local populace.

