Intelligence based joint operations launched between 10 to 17 May 2026 by #IndianArmy and #AssamRifles formations under #SpearCorps, in coordination with #ManipurPolice, in the hill and valley districts of #Manipur – Thoubal, Imphal West, Imphal East, Kakching, Tengnoupal, Bishnupur, Keibul Lamjao and Moirang, resulted in the apprehension of 10 cadres and recovery of 24 weapons, explosives and other war‑like stores.

