#RedShieldDivision, under #SpearCorps provided prompt medical assistance following a tractor accident at Semol Village, #Manipur. Swift action by the Medical Officer ensured immediate treatment to injured civilians, while two injured children were administered emergency life-saving aid and evacuated to Saikul for advanced medical care.

#RedShieldDivision ने #SpearCorps के अंतर्गत Semol Village, #Manipur में ट्रैक्टर दुर्घटना के बाद घायलों को त्वरित Medical Assistance प्रदान की। Medical Officer द्वारा Injured Civilians को तत्काल उपचार दिया गया, जबकि दो घायल बच्चों को Emergency Life-Saving Aid देकर Advanced Medical Care हेतु Saikul भेजा गया।

