Spearhead Division under #SpearCorps conducted Exercise #VijayiPrahar at forward locations, showcasing seamless integration, operational cohesion and jointness in a realistic battlefield environment. The exercise featured intensive live firing, coordinated tactical drills and integrated training with the Indo-Tibetan Border Police, enhancing interoperability, combat synergy and mission readiness in challenging terrain.

