Intelligence based joint operations launched from 05 April 2026 – 11 April 2026 by #IndianArmy and #AssamRifles formations under #SpearCorps, in coordination with #ManipurPolice in the hill and valley districts of #Manipur, namely Chandel, Tengnoupal, Imphal West, Tamenglong, Kangpokpi, Churachandpur and Bishnupur Districts have resulted in the apprehension of 07 cadres and the recovery of 54 weapons, explosives and other war-like stores.

