Intelligence based joint operations launched from 29 March 2026 to 04 April 2026 by #IndianArmy and #AssamRifles formations under #SpearCorps, in coordination with #ManipurPolice in the hill and valley districts of #Manipur, namely Kakching, Imphal East, Imphal West, Bishnupur, Churachandpur, Thoubal and Tengnoupal Districts have resulted in the apprehension of 20 cadres and the recovery of 14 weapons, explosives and other war-like stores.

