Intelligence-based joint operations conducted from 01 March to 31 March 2026 by #IndianArmy and #AssamRifles formations under #SpearCorps, in coordination with #Police in the districts of #Manipur, #Mizoram,  #ArunachalPradesh and #Assam namely Thoubal, Bishnupur, Chandel, Cachar, Churachandpur, Champhai, Changlang and Tengnoupal Districts resulted in recovery of heroin (2.74 kg approx), WY/Yaba tablets (32,266 approx), contraband substances (5.5 kg approx), foreign cigarettes (48 cases) and illegal poppy cultivation (6 acres), with a total estimated value of approx ₹35.86 Crore.

