Spearhead Division under #SpearCorps concluded the two-day Seminar on “Know Your Neighbour” at Likabali Military Station, #ArunachalPradesh on 24 March 2026. Hon’ble Governor of #ArunachalPradesh, Lt Gen KT Parnaik (Retd) and Lt Gen Abhijit S Pendharkar, GOC #SpearCorps, attended the event and shared insights on the emerging strategic contours of the region and evolving warfare domains, The seminar highlighted the role of SMEs and college students in driving awareness, innovation and future-ready thinking.

