#AssamRifles under #SpearCorps paid tribute to (Late) Major Bob Khathing at his Memorial in Awungtang, #Ukhrul, #Manipur, by laying a wreath on his birth anniversary. His visionary and peaceful expedition to #Tawang in 1951 continues to inspire unity and progress for the Nation.

