Future Proof Your Health - Importance of Nutrition to Soldiers & Families

Under the aegis of #Sapta ShaktiCommand, #GyanShaktiThink Tank organized a seminar on the topic 'Future Proof Your Health - Importance of Nutrition to Soldiers & Families' at Jaipur Military Station. Ms Jinal Shah, a renowned speaker with rich experience and deep understanding on health and nutrition addressed the soldiers, veterans and families of Sapta Shakti Command.

The Speaker covered people of all ages, discussed the importance of traditional Indian diet and beneficial eating and exercise habits during two engaging sessions followed by Q & A.
Serving and retired defence officers, JCOs, OR with families, defence civilians and students physically attended the Seminar while various other units and formations under Sapta Shakti Command attended virtually. 

