From the heartland to the Himalayan frontiers, students of #ArmyPublicSchoolJaipur, under the aegis of #SaptaShaktiCommand and with the support of Ace of Spades Division, Northern Command, embarked on an enriching ‘Reverse’ National Integration Tour to J&K to connect youth from the hinterland with India’s border regions, while fostering empathy, inclusivity and respect for the people, culture and traditions of the frontier areas. The initiative also aims to deepen appreciation for the dedication and sacrifices of the security forces safeguarding the nation.

