Institutional Synergy for Safety & Professional Excellence 🇮🇳

The delegation from Centre for Fire, Explosive and Environment Safety (CFEES), DRDO interacted with #LtGenManjinderSingh, #ArmyCommander, #SaptaShaktiCommand during their visit to #SaptaShaktiCommand.

Further strengthening collaboration for capacity building and professional excellence, an MoU was formalised between #SaptaShaktiCommand and CFEES, DRDO.

