The 6th Gen K Sundarji Memorial Lecture was conducted at Sapta Shakti Auditorium, Jaipur Military Station, hosted by the Mechanised Infantry Centre & School and CLAWS. 

The theme of the lecture was “Challenges of Pursuing Strategic Autonomy in an Increasingly Fractious World".

#LtGenManjinderSingh, #ArmyCommander, #SaptaShaktiCommand delivered the keynote, highlighting strategic autonomy as a critical imperative in today’s geopolitical volatility and complex security challenges. Eminent speakers including Ambassador Pankaj Saran and Vice Admiral SJ Singh(Retd) shared valuable perspectives.

The event organised on the occasion of raising day of the the Mechanised Infantry Regiment, brought together military professionals, policymakers and academia, fostering meaningful dialogue on strengthening India’s strategic posture while honouring Gen Sundarji’s legacy.

