Training Together, Growing Stronger.

Exercise #PRAGATI 2026 continues in full swing at Umroi, Meghalaya, as troops from 12 Friendly Foreign Countries train together in counter-terrorism operations across semi-mountainous and jungle terrain. The ongoing joint drills, tactical exercises and mission-oriented training are enhancing interoperability, operational synergy and mutual trust amongst participating nations.

Conducted in the spirit of partnership, equality and shared purpose, the exercise provides a valuable platform for professional exchange, exchange of best practices and strengthening military-to-military ties in an increasingly complex security environment.

Through collective training and shared experiences, Exercise #PRAGATI reaffirms the commitment of participating nations towards regional stability, defence cooperation and a secure Indian Ocean Region.

