Where Valour Inspires Development
#ShauryaAndSeva

Amidst the majestic Shamshabari Ridge near Sadhana Pass in Tangdhar, Kupwara, the #IndianArmy has developed the #ShauryaGatha complex - a unique initiative blending heritage, tourism, valour and community welfare. The complex includes the ‘Sadhana Café’, a Pahari Cultural Centre and a War Memorial & Museum, creating a meaningful connection between tourists and the people of India’s First Villages.

The initiative, as part of #BharatRannBhoomiDarshan, highlights the region's culture and valour of gallant soldiers while creating new opportunities for local employment, tourism and economic upliftment for border communities. A dedicated helipad at the facility also enhances emergency response and connectivity for the people of Tangdhar.

More than an infrastructure project, #ShauryaGatha reflects the enduring spirit of #ShauryaAndSeva - honouring sacrifice while empowering communities beyond the battlefield.

