In a strong demonstration of Military-Civil synergy, the Indian Army and Indian Navy, in partnership with Garden Reach Shipyard and Engineers, transported 10 additional extra-wide bridges to Sri Lanka aboard INS Gharial under Operation Sagarbandhu.

