#IndianArmy and #PunjabNationalBank have renewed their #MoU for providing banking services & Personnel Accidental Insurance (PAI) compensation in case of accidental death or disability for serving & retired personnel of Indian Army. The MoU has been extended by another three years till Jan 2029.

The MoU provides a PAl cover of ₹1 Cr for all Serving Personnel including Agniveer. The Bank is also providing Air Accident Insurance (AAI) cover of ₹1.5 Cr and other associated benefits like additional cover of ₹10 Lakh for death due to act of terrorism, Higher Education Cover of ₹20 Lakh & Girl Child Marriage Cover of upto ₹10 Lakh. In addition to this, a Special Women Power Saving Scheme wherein women would be eligible for PAI cover of upto ₹20 Lakh by maintaining a specific monthly average balance.

The renewed partnership underscores the Indian Army’s commitment to the welfare and financial security of its personnel and their families. 

