Subedar Major Durgesh Singh has today been appointed as the Army Subedar Major. Instituted on 16 June 2023, this appointment serves as a vital bridge between the Army’s senior leadership and the rank and file. He is the second junior leader to hold this prestigious post, succeeding Subedar Major & Honorary Lieutenant Gopa Kumar S.

