The GOC paid solemn homage at the ITBP War Memorial. He also engaged with ITBP troops, reinforcing the spirit of seamless synergy between forces in safeguarding national security & contributing to nation-building.

GOC laid stress on importance of JAI (Jointness, Aatmanirbharta and Innovation) as Whole of Nation approach to meet the national objective of having a future ready force which is able to carry out Multi Domain Operations as part of ViksitBharat@2047. 

