As part of Forward Area Tour 2026, an eight-member delegation from industries & startups visited the frontier areas of #GajrajCorps.

During the visit, the delegation interacted with frontier commanders & Commanding Officers on ground to gain first-hand insight into operational challenges posed by extreme high-altitude terrain & explore potential solutions. Discussions also focused on disruptive technologies, rapid capability induction & next-generation systems aimed at strengthening military-civil fusion & building a future-ready force.

