Lt Gen Neeraj Shukla, GOC, @GajrajCorps_IA visited newly established #Lachit Borphukan Military Station, Dhubri, #Assam and reviewed operational readiness & ongoing infrastructure development. The GOC lauded the efforts of the troops & commended them for their professionalism, commitment & tireless efforts in safeguarding our borders. The GOC also interacted with Capt (IN) Girish Kumar (Retd), Zila Sainik Welfare Officer, Dhubri, who has revitalised veteran support in Lower Assam, esteemed veterans & civil dignitaries.

