On his maiden visit to forward areas after assuming the command of Gajraj Corps, Lt Gen Neeraj Shukla, #GOC, #GajrajCorps paid homage to Bravehearts at Nyukmadung, Jaswantgarh & Tawang War Memorials, honouring the valour & supreme sacrifice of our heroes. He also visited the Bob Khathing Museum, paying tribute to the legacy of the legendary Major Ralengnao Bob Khathing.

