Lt Gen Gambhir Singh, #CorpsCdr #GajrajCorps, visited the Ball of Fire Division in Arunachal Pradesh. The #CorpsCdr reviewed operational readiness of the formation & also dedicated the Community Radio Station at Bomdila.

The radio station is envisioned as a grassroot level platform to share local news, promote regional culture, disseminate educational & health related content & broadcast vital public interest information as part of the Army's continued outreach in high-altitude & border regions.

He lauded the troops for their professionalism, dedication & high morale. He commended the sustained efforts undertaken by the formation to enhance combat readiness & achieve operational excellence.

Lt Gen Gambhir Singh, #CorpsCdr #GajrajCorps, ने Arunachal Pradesh में Ball of Fire Division का दौरा किया। #CorpsCdr ने यूनिट की तैयारियों की समीक्षा की और Bomdila में Community Radio Station समर्पित भी किया।

