Lt Gen Gambhir Singh, GOC #GajrajCorps, along with GOC, BlazingSwordDiv, dedicated the new building of Army Public School, Missamari, #Assam, to the students of the School. During his visit to the School, the Corps Cdr interacted with the students & encouraged them to pursue their career dreams with clarity, focus & confidence.

He also complimented the School management & the faculty for the excellent facilities & adherence to the decided timelines, which reflects their dedication & commitment to the holistic development of the students. The GOC also exhorted the faculty to work in a concerted manner to ensure that students are provided with the best possible enabling environment to learn, compete & grow.

