Lt Gen Anindya Sengupta, GOC-in-C #CentralCommand, addressed the media at #NorthTechSymposium, #Prayagraj. The event, organised by the Indian Army’s Central & Northern Commands in collaboration with @SIDMIndia, highlighted its role in strengthening indigenous defence capabilities.

#ArmyCdr stated that the theme ‘Raksha Triveni Sangam’ reflects the synergy between technology, industry and the soldier. The symposium brings together the Armed Forces, industry, startups, innovators and academia to develop field-driven solutions for critical operational challenges.

Highlighting the Middle Sector, he underscored the need for reliable systems suited for high-altitude terrain, extreme weather, limited connectivity, remote deployment, habitat support, specialised clothing, mobility and logistics.

He appreciated #SIDM, #UPEIDA, government agencies, industry partners and all stakeholders for making the symposium meaningful and outcome-oriented..

