A Model Integrated Medical Camp (#MIMC) was successfully conducted at #Bilaspur, #Chhattisgarh by HQ #COSA, dedicated to #ExServicemen, #VeerNaris, Veer Matas and their dependents.

The initiative delivered a wide spectrum of services including specialist medical consultations, diagnostics, rehabilitation support and welfare assistance. Facilitation for #SPARSH pension, #ECHS, CSD services and legal advisories ensured seamless access to essential entitlements under one roof.

Organised in close coordination with civil administration and local stakeholders, the camp witnessed participation of over 2,000 beneficiaries, reaffirming a collective commitment towards inclusive care and outreach.

The effort reflects the unwavering resolve of the #IndianArmy towards holistic veteran care, strengthening MilitaryCivilSynergy and ensuring last mile delivery of services to those who have served the Nation with honour.

