He emphasised the need to maintain operational agility, enhance vigilance and leverage emerging technologies to retain a decisive edge across the full spectrum of conflict. Stressing leadership, training rigour and institutional adaptability, he urged all ranks to remain mission-focused and prepared to respond effectively to dynamic and complex operational environments.

