In a tragic incident on 30 Apr 2026, a cruise boat carrying tourists capsized in the Bargi Dam reservoir near Khamariya Island, #Jabalpur following sudden strong winds and adverse weather conditions.

Responding promptly to a request from civil administration, the #MadhyaBharatArea launched immediate #HADR operations in close coordination with #NDRF and #SDRF teams. Medical support was extended at Military Hospital, #Jabalpur for evacuated survivors.

Demonstrating exceptional commitment, one JCO and 13 soldiers, including specialised divers of #ShatrujeetBrigade, were mobilised by air and commenced search operations at first light. Despite challenging conditions, the team recovered two deceased victims during early hours, aiding ongoing efforts to locate the missing.

The #IndianArmy stands in solidarity with the families of those affected. Our deepest condolences to the bereaved families, and prayers for the safety and early recovery of all missing individuals.

