After 22 years, the historic #MeerutPoloCup returned to the Kothawala Polo Ground, #MeerutCantt, reviving a proud equestrian legacy. Jointly hosted by Paschim Uttar Pradesh Sub Area (#PUPSA) and    
Remount Veterinary Corps (#RVC) College & Centre, the event reflected exceptional horsemanship and team spirit. In a closely contested final, the RVC Polo Team defeated #61Cavalry to lift the Winners Trophy. The winners were felicitated by Maj Gen Sumit Rana, #GOC, PUPSA.

The tournament also showcased the #IndianArmy’s continued commitment to promoting equestrian excellence, with #Agniveers displaying remarkable enthusiasm and skill. Spectacular tent pegging by RTS&D #Hempur and impressive K9 displays highlighted precision, courage and the enduring bond between man and animal.

