The Combat Weapon Training Simulator ignited curiosity and excitement, offering a glimpse into the skills and preparedness of a soldier. Yet, it was the Motivation Hall, echoing with stories of indomitable courage, grit and the legendary ethos of the 11 Gorkha Rifles, that truly stirred their souls and instilled a lasting sense of pride.

