A defining moment for #Lucknow as Smritika War Memorial transforms into a beacon of pride and remembrance with the inauguration of a state-of-the-art Laser, Light & Sound Show by Hon’ble Raksha Mantri Shri Rajnath Singh.

This Half an hour immersive Hindi show brings alive the saga of the #IndianArmy,  glorious legacy, decisive battles and unmatched operational excellence. A special tribute to the #Bravehearts of #Awadh, whose courage and sacrifice echo through generations.

As light meets legacy, the memorial narrates stories of valour with striking visuals, powerful soundscapes and evocative storytelling,
turning history into a living experience.

Hon’ble Chief Minister Shri Yogi Adityanath, Lt Gen Anindya Sengupta, GOC-in-C #CentralCommand, along with senior officials of the #SuryaCommand and state government, were present on the occasion, reaffirming a collective commitment to honour those who serve.

Where technology meets tradition, Smritika now stands not just as a memorial, but as a dynamic tribute, educating, inspiring and instilling pride in every visitor.

