Equine Breeding Stud, #Babugarh has introduced Agricultural Spraying Drone Technology, marking a pioneering step in modernising military farming practices within the #IndianArmy. The initiative enhances precision in fodder crop management for Army equines, enabling optimal utilisation of manpower, reduced chemical usage, improved crop monitoring, higher yield and significant water conservation.

Equipped with smart speaker capability, the drone also aids in deterring wild animals including blue bulls, ensuring effective crop protection. A forward-looking initiative driving sustainable, technology-enabled and Atmanirbhar farming practices in support of operational readiness.

