A lecture on “Restart Your Career” was organised at Surya Auditorium, #Lucknow, by Ms Shreya Prakash Co-founder & CEO of #FlexiBees, highlighting emerging opportunities for women to re-enter the workforce through flexible and remote roles. The session was attended by Mrs Ruchira Sengupta, Regional President #AWWA, along with families of #SuryaCommand .

The initiative showcased the work of #FlexiBees ,an @IIM _Bangalore founded platform exclusively for skilled women to connect such professional women with businesses through work from home, part-time, project-based and remote roles with flexible working hours of 4–5 hours a day. With a strong focus on enabling career re-entry, the platform offers opportunities across marketing, sales, HR, content, design and technology domains, supporting skilled women in balancing professional aspirations with personal commitments.

The session served as a meaningful step towards empowering women, fostering self-reliance and creating pathways for sustainable career growth.

