A Skill Development Training Program was conducted at Development Block Nindura, #Barabanki, under the aegis of the Block Education Department and executed by ASHA School #Lucknow.

In a unique and inspiring initiative, two students along with vocational teachers from ASHA School led practical training in soap making for 10 teachers and 10 students from the block. Marking a first, young learners stepped forward to upskill their peers, showcasing confidence, capability and the true spirit of learning.

The initiative is set to benefit nearly 9,000 registered students and 901 teachers across the development block, fostering self-reliance, vocational awareness and preparedness for future challenges. ASHA School Lucknow continues to promote inclusive learning and collaborative growth, empowering children to contribute meaningfully to society.

