Under the aegis of #AWWA, #CommandHospital #Lucknow conducted the final offline session of the #GarbhSanskar programme in hybrid mode, with participation from units across #CentralCommand. The session focused on holistic antenatal care during pregnancy, highlighting the importance of safe physical exercises, maternal wellbeing and healthy lifestyle practices for expectant mothers.
The initiative provided valuable guidance to expecting families and reinforced the commitment towards promoting healthy motherhood and family wellbeing within the Army community..

The programme highlighted the importance of maintaining a healthy body and a positive mindset during pregnancy, empowering families with knowledge and practical guidance for safe motherhood. Enthusiastic participation by expecting mothers and their families made the session a meaningful platform for awareness, support and community bonding.

Such initiatives reflect the continued commitment of #AWWA and #AFMS towards the health, wellbeing and holistic care of Army families.

