An ESM Rally Medical Camp was organised at #Varanasi by #39GTC under the aegis of #MadhyaBharatArea. As part of the rally, teams from Military Hospital and Military Dental Centre #Varanasi conducted a comprehensive Medical and Dental Camp for veterans and their dependents.

A team of 27 specialist and subspecialist doctors from ECHS empanelled hospitals provided expert consultations across multiple disciplines including cardiology neurology gastroenterology and orthopaedics. Over the two day camp, 397 veterans and dependents benefited from the medical services while 57 dental cases were attended to by the team from MDC Varanasi.

The initiative reflects the #IndianArmy’s enduring commitment towards the welfare of its veterans and their families while reaffirming the bond of trust care and respect with those who have served the nation with pride.

