Maj Gen Amit Singh Sohal,  #GOC PUP & MP Sub Area, inaugurated the rally and interacted with the veterans, acknowledging their invaluable service and reaffirming the Indian Army’s steadfast commitment to their welfare and dignity.

Medical camps, super-speciality consultations and dedicated help desks by SPARSH, Record Offices and PCDA (Pensions) assisted veterans in resolving pension issues and accessing welfare initiatives. The event also reflected the sustained outreach of Station HQ and 39 GTC in strengthening the enduring bond with the veteran fraternity.

