The majestic hills of Kumaon are gearing up for the first-ever Zorawar Cycle Rally, an extraordinary journey through winding mountain roads, pristine valleys and the breathtaking landscapes of the Himalayas.

Riders from the #IndianArmy, spirited women cyclists representing #NariShakti, and determined cadets from #RIMC will soon embark on this challenging yet inspiring expedition across the Kumaon region.

