Traversing demanding terrain and high-altitude routes, the rally will highlight the synergy between youth, soldiers and adventure enthusiasts while promoting fitness, resilience and exploration in one of India’s most spectacular mountain landscapes.

The countdown has begun as the riders prepare to conquer the hills and experience the thrill of cycling amidst the towering peaks and serene valleys of Uttarakhand.

