On #WorldWildlifeDay, the Army Air Defence Centre at #GopalpurMilitaryStation marked the occasion with a meaningful initiative to promote environmental awareness among Agniveers.

A special Wildlife Awareness Film highlighting India’s rich flora, diverse fauna and vibrant natural heritage was screened, reinforcing the importance of conservation and ecological balance in national development.
The engagement extended beyond the auditorium as Agniveers undertook a guided wildlife observation tour around the scenic Monsoon Magic Lake within the station.

They witnessed migratory and seasonal birds that visit the campus annually, gaining first-hand insight into biodiversity thriving alongside military life.
The initiative strengthened environmental consciousness, deepened understanding of wildlife conservation and reaffirmed the commitment of young soldiers to serve not only the nation’s security but also its natural legacy.

