Strengthening the shield of community health, a Measles & Rubella (MR) Booster Dose Vaccination Drive for school children (05–10 years) was conducted at #AgraCantt, under the supervision of SEMO and SHO (L) Agra, with the theme “दो बीमारियों को हरायेंगे, ये टीका जरूर लगायेंगे”.

Organised under the aegis of the Ministry of Health & Family Welfare and supported by the Office of the District Immunization Officer, #Agra and the Regional Office of the World Health Organization, the initiative focused on building early immunity against preventable diseases.

A total of 1,020 students from seven schools across Agra Cantonment, including APS Agra, PM Shri Kendriya Vidyalaya Agra 1 & 2 and Golden Fish Primary School were administered the MR booster dose, reaffirming AFMS commitment to the ethos.

