“Half The Heart, Double The Fight.”

In observance of Congenital Heart Disease Awareness Week, the Golden Key Combat Healers undertook a comprehensive outreach to spread awareness on early detection, preventive care and life-saving interventions for children born with heart defects.

Expert medical lectures, focused screening drives covering 243 students (against a target of 1000), poster exhibitions and interactive quizzes were organised to sensitise young minds and families on recognising symptoms and seeking timely treatment. The initiative reinforced that awareness and knowledge remain the first line of defence in protecting young lives.

A spirited Walkathon themed “Half the Heart, Double the Fight” witnessed participation of troops, families, parents and children at #BirpurBrigade and Military Hospital, #Dehradun, a powerful show of solidarity towards saving little hearts and supporting affected families.

Through compassion, medical excellence and community engagement, the #IndianArmy continues to stand committed to safeguarding every heartbeat.

