*"Innovation Today, Operational Dominance Tomorrow."* 

In a significant stride towards operational innovation, 1 Signal Training Centre, #Jabalpur successfully demonstrated its indigenously developed Fibre Laying Drone, designed and built using low-cost 3D-printed components and in-house technical expertise.

The system’s capabilities were showcased across challenging terrain, including hilly stretches and water obstacles, validating its effectiveness in complex field conditions. The live demonstration was witnessed by #GOC Madhya Bharat Area, who commended the ingenuity, technical proficiency and forward-looking approach of the team.

By enabling rapid fibre optic cable deployment in difficult and high-risk environments, the innovation substantially enhances battlefield communication networks while reducing manpower requirements and operational exposure.
This pioneering effort marks a notable milestone on the #PathToTransformation, strengthening tactical connectivity and reinforcing the Indian Army’s commitment towards self-reliance under #AtmanirbharBharat.

