From mastering night field engineering and moving mammoth loads to live mine training and long distance endurance marches, these combat engineers push beyond limits to remain battle ready at all times.

Whether establishing critical water points, constructing complex obstacle systems or executing high precision demolition that lights up the night sky, their expertise ensures freedom of manoeuvre across every terrain. Through smoke, fire and controlled detonations, they clear paths to victory, proving that no obstacle can stand before those who engineer the fight.

