From Dehradun to the towering Himalayan passes, the #SuryaQuestMotorcycle Expedition 2025 unfolded as a remarkable journey of endurance, brotherhood and purpose.

Army riders and civilian motorcycle enthusiasts rode side by side through demanding terrain, thin air and harsh weather, retracing routes protected by soldiers and marked by sacrifice. From #Shimla to #Sumdo and onward to #Leh, each mile strengthened unity, resilience and respect for the mountains that safeguard our frontiers.

Beyond an expedition, Surya Quest 2025 emerged as a powerful tribute to the spirit of adventure, the strength of civil military partnership and the unwavering commitment of the #IndianArmy to the nation.

