#MilitaryHospitalMeerut reaffirmed its commitment to comprehensive #VeteranCare by organising a Multi-Speciality Medical Camp at #Shamli, #UttarPradesh, under 
#OpSPARSH 2.0. The outreach initiative reflects the Indian Army’s continued focus on taking quality healthcare closer to veterans and their families.

The camp was inaugurated by Maj Gen Sumit Rana, #GOC #PUPSA and witnessed strong participation with over 400 patients registering and benefiting from specialist consultations, on-site diagnostic facilities and dietetics support. The initiative was conducted under the “Home to OT” framework, ensuring seamless identification and referral of patients requiring advanced care.

Over the past year, several patients identified through such outreach camps have successfully undergone definitive treatment at #MilitaryHospitalMeerut, highlighting #AFMS’ sustained commitment to accessible, veteran-centric healthcare and compassionate service for those who have served the nation.

