The conclave was attended by Lt Gen Anindya Sengupta, GOC-in-C #CentralCommand and Air Marshal Balakrishnan Manikantan, AOC-in-C #CentralAirCommand. Professional minds from both Services engaged in candid and forward-looking deliberations on current challenges and the way ahead.

