On #NationalTourismDay 2026, #SuryaCommand invites citizens to explore India’s most inspiring frontiers where spirituality heritage and natural grandeur meet the resolve of the Nation.

From the sacred heights of #AdiKailash and the awe inspiring #OmParvat to the timeless mystique of #Gue with its centuries old heritage the journey is both spiritual and transformative. Experience the living culture of India’s first villages at #Mana and #Malari where tradition resilience and hospitality thrive against dramatic mountain backdrops. Discover the stark beauty of the cold desert at #SpitiValley and stand at the historic gateway of the Himalayas at #ShipkiLa Pass.

These locations are not just destinations they are stories of faith endurance and national pride. Responsible tourism here empowers local communities preserves fragile ecosystems and strengthens the bond between citizens and the frontiers they cherish. 

Come travel with respect return with pride and rediscover India where the Nation stands guard.

