A JE Training Cadre for Junior Engineers of #CentralCommand AoR was conducted as a focused capacity building initiative to enhance technical proficiency and operational preparedness. The cadre was inaugurated with a keynote address by CECC, outlining clear professional standards and military objectives.

The four day structured training was systematically organised with two days each dedicated to JE (B/R) and JE (E/M). Certified training modules were delivered by ECI, an organisation authorised under the Ministry of Skill Development, combining operational case studies hands on practical training and structured site visits.

A total of 24 JE (B/R) and 21 JE (E/M) participated in the programme. Instruction was imparted by experienced domain specialists industry leaders and emerging technology experts reinforcing technical excellence discipline and mission readiness across the #SuryaCommand Area of Responsibility.

