She was accompanied by the GOC, Madhya UP Sub Area, the Chairperson FWO Madhya UP Sub Area and Maj Vishal Kanaujia, whose sustained efforts, perseverance and close coordination over time ensured dignity, protection and lawful restitution during a period of profound personal hardship.

The interaction reaffirmed responsive governance, strong military–civil synergy and the Indian Army’s enduring commitment to stand by its extended family with responsibility, resolve and humanity.

