An ECHS multi-speciality medical camp was organised at #Satna, #MadhyaPradesh, under the aegis of HQ Madhya Bharat Area, (#MBAREA) reaffirming the Indian Army’s enduring commitment to the health and wellbeing of its Veterans and their families.

Specialists from Military Hospital and Military Dental Centre #Jabalpur, covering Medicine, General Surgery, Gynaecology, Eye, ENT and Dental care, provided expert consultations to Veterans, their dependants and Veer Naris from Satna and nearby areas. The initiative was widely appreciated for its reach, quality of care and personal attention.

Dr Satish S, District Collector Satna, visited the camp and interacted with the medical team. He lauded the efforts and complimented the team for delivering professional healthcare support with dedication and compassion.

Around 500 Veterans and dependants benefitted from the camp, reflecting strong military–civil cooperation and the Army’s resolve to stand by those who have served the Nation.

