A significant step towards accessible and responsive justice delivery was marked with the inauguration of the Armed Forces Tribunal Circuit Bench at #Cuttack, #Odisha. The Circuit Bench was inaugurated by Hon’ble Mr Justice Harish Tandon Chief Justice High Court of Orissa in the presence of Lt Gen PS Shekhawat #GOC, #MadhyaBharatArea.

The establishment of the Circuit Bench will greatly enhance grievance redressal mechanisms for veterans and serving personnel across Odisha and adjoining regions by bringing judicial processes closer to them. This initiative reflects the enduring commitment of the Armed Forces and civil institutions towards veterans’ welfare dignity and timely justice.

The milestone was made possible through the sustained efforts of Chhattisgarh and Odisha Sub Area in close coordination with the High Court of Odisha demonstrating effective military–civil synergy in action.

