Senior leaders reviewed ongoing outreach programmes for veterans and Veer Naris including resettlement opportunities skill initiatives and access to welfare facilities across Odisha. The state authorities assured full support to the Armed Forces community highlighting the importance of timely grievance redress and inclusive engagement with families of former soldiers.

