#IndianArmy (#EME), Larsen &Toubro and Tata Advanced Systems Ltd joined hands at 510 Army Base Workshop for overhaul and upgrade of the Pinaka Weapon System. This partnership aims at quicker readiness, induction of modern technology and effective management of equipment obsolescence with indigenous strength.

