Marking the culmination of a year-long Veterans Outreach Programme, #GoldenKeyGunners conducted a Felicitation Ceremony at #Dehradun on behalf of #GoldenKeyDivision. The initiative focused on door-to-door outreach, grievance redressal and resolution of #SPARSH related issues.

Maj Gen Naveen Mahajan, GOC #GoldenKeyDivision, felicitated disabled Veterans with essential medical aids including electric scooters, wheelchairs and hearing aids, enabling dignity, mobility and independence. As part of the green initiative, 10 e-rickshaws were also flagged off to provide free eco-friendly transport for Veterans, troops and families.

