The 11th Gorkha Rifles commemorates its 79th #RaisingDay, celebrating a glorious legacy of unmatched bravery, discipline and devotion to duty. The first Regiment raised after Independence, with 3/11 GR being the first battalion raised in Free India, the Regiment has stood as a symbol of courage and steadfast commitment to the Nation.
From historic battlefields to modern challenges, the Gorkha warriors have always exemplified honour, sacrifice and professionalism, carrying forward a proud martial tradition that inspires generations.

With deep respect, we salute the indomitable spirit, valour and selfless service of the warriors of 11 GR who continue to guard the Nation with pride.

