#IndianNavy Meteorological and Oceanological Symposium – Meghayan 26, was conducted on 30 Apr 26 at #INSHansa in Goa under the aegis of #HQWNC, to mark #WorldMeteorologicalDay.

Inaugurated by VAdm Krishna Swaminathan #FOCINC #WNC in virtual mode, the symposium focused on aviation weather forecasting with particular focus on naval aviation and featured insightful technical sessions on aviation nowcasting, bridging the last tactical mile, and leveraging #AI for decision superiority.

Dr. Mrutyunjay Mohapatra, DG @Indiametdept, delivered the keynote address. Adm Arun Prakash (Retd), Adm Karambir Singh (Retd) and RAdm Vikram Menon #FOK joined the scientific community and officers from @IAF_MCC, Space Applications Centre, Ahmedabad, @ncaor_goa, @ncmrwfmoes, and @iitmpune on discussions on aviation meteorological excellence and maritime safety.

The 11th edition of Sagarmanthan, the #IndianNavy Meteorology and Oceanography journal, was released during the event.

