#IndianNavy - Industry Synergy Conclave was conducted under the aegis of #HQWNC at #NavalDockyard, Mumbai on 06 Mar 26. The conclave provided a forum for interaction between senior Naval officers and Industry Captains.

Conducted in association with @BombayChamber, the conclave reaffirmed the shared commitment towards advancing India’s maritime capability under the #AtmanirbharBharat and #MakeInIndia initiatives. Ongoing indigenisation efforts of the #IndianNavy and areas for collaboration in defence technology and innovation were deliberated upon during the conclave which also saw attendance by representatives from Government agencies.

Addressing the gathering, VAdm Krishna Swaminathan #FOCINC #WNC outlined the #IndianNavy’s post-independence growth and the requirement to balance indigenisation versus imports. Citing volatile geopolitics, he urged industry leaders to build capacity and adopt emerging tech to achieve complete self-reliance.

The interaction concluded with an insightful tour of guided missile destroyer #INSImphal and submarine #INSVela, highlighting maritime shipbuilding capabilities.

